<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1363955165"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1733847612"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="We can go now!"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="イルミネーションスターズ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="THE IDOLM@STER SHINY COLORS FR@GMENT WING 02"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:37.160"><div begin="00:02.380" end="03:37.160"><p begin="00:02.380" end="00:05.070" itunes:key="L1">We can go now! We can go now!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就此出发 现在就此出发</span></p><p begin="00:05.070" end="00:07.850" itunes:key="L2">ひとりじゃないよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="00:07.850" end="00:10.600" itunes:key="L3">We can go now! We can go now!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就此出发 现在就此出发</span></p><p begin="00:10.600" end="00:12.720" itunes:key="L4">とびっきり笑顔でいこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上最美好的笑容出发</span></p><p begin="00:16.230" end="00:18.940" itunes:key="L5">上がってくよ グッとスピード<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一鼓作气</span></p><p begin="00:18.940" end="00:21.160" itunes:key="L6">ゴール切って会えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冲破终点再去迎接</span></p><p begin="00:21.160" end="00:27.790" itunes:key="L7">スタートライン starshine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下一个起点 下一个起点</span></p><p begin="00:27.790" end="00:30.180" itunes:key="L8">箱の中に押し込めたまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终这样将热情塞满箱子</span></p><p begin="00:30.180" end="00:32.610" itunes:key="L9">熱されてるポテンシャル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便会逐渐升温的内在潜能</span></p><p begin="00:32.610" end="00:38.690" itunes:key="L10">膨らんで弾けそう...！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断膨胀 不断膨胀</span></p><p begin="00:38.690" end="00:41.560" itunes:key="L11">HEY HEY! It's like like Popcorn!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 嘿 就像是爆米花</span></p><p begin="00:41.560" end="00:44.040" itunes:key="L12">HEY HEY! Just like like Pop up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 嘿 嘿 即将要爆发</span></p><p begin="00:44.040" end="00:46.990" itunes:key="L13">HEY HEY! It's like like Popcorn!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 嘿 就像是爆米花</span></p><p begin="00:46.990" end="00:48.890" itunes:key="L14">HEY HEY! Are you ready go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶 嘿 嘿 准备好了吗</span></p><p begin="00:48.890" end="00:49.730" itunes:key="L15">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span></p><p begin="00:49.730" end="00:55.000" itunes:key="L16">きらり きらり きらり光る 眩しいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一闪 一闪</span></p><p begin="00:55.000" end="00:58.160" itunes:key="L17">もっと前へ！OK!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更加向前 OK 向前 OK</span></p><p begin="00:58.160" end="01:00.590" itunes:key="L18">助走をつけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">趁着助跑的力度</span></p><p begin="01:00.590" end="01:01.270" itunes:key="L19">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span></p><p begin="01:01.270" end="01:06.490" itunes:key="L20">ひらく ひらく ひらく扉 目の前で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开 打开</span></p><p begin="01:06.490" end="01:11.640" itunes:key="L21">君の未来を 照らし出すから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的未来 未来</span></p><p begin="01:11.640" end="01:12.800" itunes:key="L22">イルミネーション<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">illumination</span></p><p begin="01:12.800" end="01:15.510" itunes:key="L23">We can go now! We can go now!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就此出发 现在就此出发</span></p><p begin="01:15.510" end="01:18.490" itunes:key="L24">ひとりじゃないよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="01:18.490" end="01:21.210" itunes:key="L25">We can go now! We can go now!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就此出发 现在就此出发</span></p><p begin="01:21.210" end="01:23.200" itunes:key="L26">とびっきり笑顔でいこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上最美好的笑容出发</span></p><p begin="01:26.720" end="01:29.700" itunes:key="L27">何をしても上手くいかない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论做什么都不会一帆风顺</span></p><p begin="01:29.700" end="01:31.830" itunes:key="L28">そんな時もあるね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔会有这样的时候</span></p><p begin="01:31.830" end="01:38.350" itunes:key="L29">泣かないで めげないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要哭泣 不要哭泣</span></p><p begin="01:38.350" end="01:41.200" itunes:key="L30">溜まりきったラッキーたちが<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始终都在</span></p><p begin="01:41.200" end="01:43.620" itunes:key="L31">押し寄せて 君へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正慢慢靠近你身边</span></p><p begin="01:43.620" end="01:49.520" itunes:key="L32">今にも弾けそう...！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许现在 或许现在</span></p><p begin="01:49.520" end="01:52.150" itunes:key="L33">HEY HEY! It's like like Popcorn!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 嘿 就像是爆米花</span></p><p begin="01:52.150" end="01:55.020" itunes:key="L34">HEY HEY! Just like like Pop up!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嘿 嘿 嘿 即将要爆发</span></p><p begin="01:55.020" end="01:57.860" itunes:key="L35">HEY HEY! It's like like Popcorn!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 嘿 嘿 就像是爆米花</span></p><p begin="01:57.860" end="01:59.900" itunes:key="L36">HEY HEY! Are you ready go?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耶 嘿 嘿 准备好了吗</span></p><p begin="01:59.900" end="02:00.790" itunes:key="L37">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span></p><p begin="02:00.790" end="02:05.850" itunes:key="L38">きらり きらり きらり光る 眩しいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一闪 一闪</span></p><p begin="02:05.850" end="02:08.780" itunes:key="L39">もっと前へ！OK!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更加向前 OK</span></p><p begin="02:08.780" end="02:10.900" itunes:key="L40">大丈夫だよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有问题</span></p><p begin="02:10.900" end="02:11.550" itunes:key="L41">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span></p><p begin="02:11.550" end="02:16.740" itunes:key="L42">願う 願う 願う叶う 叶えてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许愿 许愿</span></p><p begin="02:16.740" end="02:22.140" itunes:key="L43">だから一緒に この青空を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因此让我们一起 一起</span></p><p begin="02:22.140" end="02:23.380" itunes:key="L44">駆け回ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自由地翱翔吧</span></p><p begin="02:28.640" end="02:31.540" itunes:key="L45">イ・ル・ミ・ネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I RU MI NE</span></p><p begin="02:31.540" end="02:34.480" itunes:key="L46">Everybody let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各位伙伴 让我们出发</span></p><p begin="02:34.480" end="02:37.240" itunes:key="L47">イ・ル・ミ・ネ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I RU MI NE</span></p><p begin="02:37.240" end="02:38.510" itunes:key="L48">Everybody let's go!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各位伙伴 让我们出发</span></p><p begin="02:50.610" end="02:51.370" itunes:key="L49">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span></p><p begin="02:51.370" end="02:56.620" itunes:key="L50">きらり きらり きらり光る 眩しいよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一闪 一闪</span></p><p begin="02:56.620" end="02:59.420" itunes:key="L51">もっと前へ！OK!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">更加向前 OK 向前 OK</span></p><p begin="02:59.420" end="03:02.040" itunes:key="L52">助走をつけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">趁着助跑的力度</span></p><p begin="03:02.040" end="03:02.760" itunes:key="L53">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span></p><p begin="03:02.760" end="03:07.970" itunes:key="L54">ひらく ひらく ひらく扉 目の前で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">打开 打开</span></p><p begin="03:07.970" end="03:13.290" itunes:key="L55">君の未来を 照らし出すから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的未来 未来</span></p><p begin="03:13.290" end="03:13.880" itunes:key="L56">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span></p><p begin="03:13.880" end="03:19.120" itunes:key="L57">願う 願う 願う叶う 叶えてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">许愿 许愿</span></p><p begin="03:19.120" end="03:24.420" itunes:key="L58">だから一緒に この青空を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因此让我们一起 一起</span></p><p begin="03:24.420" end="03:25.580" itunes:key="L59">駆け回ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自由地翱翔吧</span></p><p begin="03:25.580" end="03:28.280" itunes:key="L60">We can go now! We can go now!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就此出发 现在就此出发</span></p><p begin="03:28.280" end="03:31.300" itunes:key="L61">ひとりじゃないよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你并不是孤身一人</span></p><p begin="03:31.300" end="03:34.200" itunes:key="L62">We can go now! We can go now!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在就此出发 现在就此出发</span></p><p begin="03:34.200" end="03:37.160" itunes:key="L63">とびっきり笑顔でいこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带上最美好的笑容出发</span></p></div></body></tt>